0.7.0	Weather table: "..." link to windy.com after the wind data of each hour (planned date and hour, UTC rounded to the 3-hour step of Windy, centred on the route, zoom keeps the route in view)

0.6.0	Protected zones (nature reserves, protected areas): the planner asks the user, with the zone and the length, before it crosses one; military, private and fenced zones stay closed always

0.5.0	Main roads (trunk, primary) without cycle infrastructure: the planner asks the user, with the road and the length, before it uses them as a last resort; presets.allow_main_roads, route_graph.main_road_length_km

0.4.0	No padding of a short route with empty spurs without the user's permission (four options offered); repeated share of a route (`repeated_share`); a loop with more than 30 % repeated length must state it; archive_validate checks padding permission and the statement

0.3.0	Bike presets: tertiary, unclassified, service/road (fallback), steps (cost), corridor, bridleway, footway/pedestrian need bicycle=yes; anchored Overpass regex; minimum route length (default 1/2 of the maximum), checks and questions to the user, archive_validate minimum check

0.2.1	README: short end-to-end example (route, map, day plan)


